{"title": "Inoculated: Basic Poison (Condition)", "pageid": 25305, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Inoculated:_Basic_Poison_(Condition)", "categories": ["Has stack type", "Conditions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">  \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\"> \n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d3/Generic_Poison_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Poison_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d3/Generic_Poison_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Generic_Poison_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d3/Generic_Poison_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Generic_Poison_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Generic Poison Condition Icon.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d3/Generic_Poison_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Poison_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/d/d3/Generic_Poison_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <b>Inoculated: Basic Poison</b>\n</p>\n</div>\n<ul><li>You succeeded on a <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Saving Throw\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_Throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving Throw\">Saving Throw</a> against <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Poisoned_(Basic_Poison)_(Condition)\" title=\"Poisoned (Basic Poison) (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e9/Poisoned_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Poisoned_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e9/Poisoned_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Poisoned_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e9/Poisoned_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Poisoned_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Poisoned\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e9/Poisoned_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Poisoned_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e9/Poisoned_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Poisoned_(Basic_Poison)_(Condition)\" title=\"Poisoned (Basic Poison) (Condition)\">Poisoned</a> and can't be affected by it. </li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\">Properties</span></h2>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" title=\"Stack ID\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Info_Icon.png/25px-Info_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/b/b2/Info_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Stack ID\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Info_Icon.png/25px-Info_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b2/Info_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stack ID\">Stack ID</a>: <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">POISON_SIMPLE_IMMUNE</code> <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=%22data%2CStackId%2CPOISON_SIMPLE_IMMUNE%22+type:status\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=%22data%2CStackId%2CPOISON_SIMPLE_IMMUNE%22+type:status\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span>\n</p>\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Conditions#Stack_type\" title=\"Conditions\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9a/Sort_Icon.png/25px-Sort_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/9a/Sort_Icon.png/38px-Sort_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/9/9a/Sort_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"If already applied\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9a/Sort_Icon.png/25px-Sort_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/9a/Sort_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Conditions#Stack_type\" title=\"Conditions\">If already applied</a>: do not apply</div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\">Notes</span></h2>\n<ul><li>This condition only grants immunity to the version of poison granted by <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Basic_Poison\" title=\"Basic Poison\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0f/COAT_Basic_Poison_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-COAT_Basic_Poison_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0f/COAT_Basic_Poison_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-COAT_Basic_Poison_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0f/COAT_Basic_Poison_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-COAT_Basic_Poison_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0f/COAT_Basic_Poison_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-COAT_Basic_Poison_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0f/COAT_Basic_Poison_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Basic_Poison\" title=\"Basic Poison\">Basic Poison</a> and not other Poisoned conditions.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Sources_of_Inoculated:_Basic_Poison\">Sources of Inoculated: Basic Poison</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition-sources\"><ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"min-width: 30px;\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Coated_in_Basic_Poison_(Condition)\" title=\"Coated in Basic Poison (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Coated_in_Basic_Poison_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Coated_in_Basic_Poison_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Coated_in_Basic_Poison_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Coated_in_Basic_Poison_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Coated_in_Basic_Poison_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Coated_in_Basic_Poison_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Coated in Basic Poison\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Coated_in_Basic_Poison_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Coated_in_Basic_Poison_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Coated_in_Basic_Poison_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Coated_in_Basic_Poison_(Condition)\" title=\"Coated in Basic Poison (Condition)\">Coated in Basic Poison</a></span></li>\n</ul></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714234401\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.059 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.064 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2051/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 25932/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 8458/41943